Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.57,0:06:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}（约克郡 英格兰北部）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.38,0:07:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}（索里修道院）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.93,0:16:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}（英格兰北部 约克郡）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.30,0:20:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}（杭斯顿宫 赫特福德郡）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.16,0:27:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}（意大利 甘道夫堡 教皇夏宫）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.91,0:29:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}（约克郡）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.42,0:40:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}（林肯郡）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.44,0:01:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 珍？- 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jane? - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.29,0:01:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们聚集在此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are come here together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在上帝面前 诸位一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}before god and these witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}见证亨利八世\N{\fnArial\fs30}to join in Holy matrimony Henry VIII,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.39,0:01:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰和法兰西国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}King of England and France,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.52,0:02:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}信仰的守卫者\N{\fnArial\fs30}defender of the faith,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.10,0:02:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰教会最高领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supreme Head of the Church of England,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.03,0:02:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和珍·西摩女士的神圣婚姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Lady Jane Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.63,0:02:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若诸位之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if there be any among you…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.04,0:02:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有谁对他们的婚姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}who may imagine some impediments…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.83,0:02:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}存有异议\N{\fnArial\fs30}as to why they should not be married,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.71,0:02:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请现在提出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them now speak out,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.15,0:02:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}否则永缄其口\N{\fnArial\fs30}or forever hold their tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.07,0:02:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你给我的礼物 太漂亮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for my gift, it's so very beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.20,0:02:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}须臾该当谢谢你给我的「礼物」才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I soon trust to thank you for mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.57,0:02:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去跳舞好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we join in the dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.26,0:03:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Music.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.37,0:03:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我很内疚 - 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I feel guilty. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.85,0:03:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为有时我竟会忘了你有多美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because sometimes I forget about how beautiful you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.46,0:03:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想她会使他快乐的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she'll make him happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.10,0:03:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老天帮忙 我们都可以安心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God's help, we'll all be happy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.99,0:04:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我好像不认识你 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't recognize you, my lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.32,0:04:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是新进宫的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you new at court?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.63,0:04:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我将成为王后陛下的女侍官之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Sir. I am to be a maid to her Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.33,0:04:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请问芳名\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.05,0:04:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}厄苏拉·米塞尔登女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Ursula Misseldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.46,0:04:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道我是谁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.26,0:04:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您是弗兰西斯·布赖恩爵士 久闻大名\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Sir Francis Bryan. I've heard about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.67,0:04:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都听说了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.04,0:04:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你喜欢脚踏两只船\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like to board other man's boats.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.71,0:04:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信不久后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust that I shall be seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.60,0:04:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会常见 米塞尔登女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}a lot more of you, Lady Misseldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.47,0:04:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然国王的两位女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since both the King's daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.26,0:04:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都因没有合法地位而失去了继承权\N{\fnArial\fs30}have been declared illegimate and unfit to rule,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.26,0:04:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们只能期望王后尽快怀上孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}we must trust the queen to conceive a child quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.09,0:04:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我仍然担心 安妮的死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still fear, with Anne's death,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.11,0:04:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}使我们失去了忠实的朋友和坚强的后盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've lost a great friend and a powerful supporter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.11,0:04:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果新王后真如谣言所说\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the new Queen favors the Catholic religion,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.02,0:04:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是个天主教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}as she is rumored to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.98,0:04:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我们的整个改革就可能陷于危险境地\N{\fnArial\fs30}then our whole reformation is surely in jeopardy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.42,0:04:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很吃惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a suprise,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.02,0:04:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你竟然非常不信任国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have such little faith in the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.86,0:05:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除非我们加紧解散那些妓院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless we press ahead the dissalution of those brothels.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.94,0:05:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}灭除那些所谓有良知的下流胚们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and slaughter whores of the conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.42,0:05:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些修道院啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The monasteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.64,0:05:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奉圣父 圣子 及圣神之名 阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}In nomine Patris, et Filii, et Spiritus Sancti. Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.65,0:05:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全能的永生的真神 求主加增我们的信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almighty and Everlasting God give onto us the increase of faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.23,0:05:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如同您许诺的赐我们希望与慈悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}hope and charity and that we may obtain that which Thou dost promise,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.20,0:05:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}按照您的旨意使我们相爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}make us to love that which Thou dost command.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.27,0:05:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}靠耶酥基督 我们的主\N{\fnArial\fs30}through Jesus Christ, our lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.58,0:05:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.16,0:05:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 如果可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, If I may,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.41,0:05:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有份结婚礼呈送陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a wedding gift for Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它原先归凯瑟琳王后所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}It once belonged to Queen Katherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.59,0:05:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank You.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.02,0:05:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下驾到\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty, the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.72,0:06:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 吾妻 - 夫君\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wife. - Husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.50,0:06:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我们不必当众进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think we need to proceed in public.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.21,0:06:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少不是这次\N{\fnArial\fs30}not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.77,0:06:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.98,0:07:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让路 国王特使驾到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make way, the King's commissioners.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.29,0:07:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确保万事周全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be assure everything is accounted for.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.80,0:07:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 法兰克士大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Dr. Frankish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.78,0:07:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法兰克士大人 这儿有个富婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Frankish, here's a wealthy Madonna.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.59,0:07:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这件不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here is a fine one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.39,0:07:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}丝质外套 大量珠宝 价值连城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coat of silk, ton of jewels, wealth property.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.15,0:07:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.85,0:07:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在是不是一无所有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}are you stripped now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.83,0:07:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿斯克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Aske.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.17,0:08:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看他们都做了什么 约翰 看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what they've done, John. Just look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.89,0:08:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全是克伦威尔搞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all Cromwell's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.14,0:08:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔和伦敦的那帮异教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cromwell and that sect of heretics in London,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.50,0:08:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}that bustard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.82,0:08:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一定要告诉你 阿斯克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you this Mr.Aske, people,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.48,0:08:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大家再也不想袖手旁观了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're no longer willing to stand by,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.22,0:08:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不想眼看着自己的信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}and watch their faith,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.47,0:08:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自己所关心的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}and everything that they care for,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.89,0:08:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都被剥夺\N{\fnArial\fs30}being stripped away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.81,0:08:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听说昨天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard just yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.82,0:08:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔的两个特使\N{\fnArial\fs30}that two of Cromwell's commisioners were attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.44,0:08:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在林肯郡被袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Lincolnshire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.55,0:08:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而在这里 约克郡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here in Yorkshire,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.72,0:08:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}群众之中有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a man of the commons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.39,0:08:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在自己的教堂里挺身而出\N{\fnArial\fs30}stood up in his own church.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.81,0:08:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呼吁我们去追随耶稣\N{\fnArial\fs30}and said go away to follow the crosses.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.40,0:08:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为等他们将一切夺走之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what they've taken from us,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.62,0:08:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们就会无所追随\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can follow them no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.93,0:08:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想让我怎么做呢 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I supposed to do, John?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.35,0:08:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}林肯郡以及其他地方的民众\N{\fnArial\fs30}The commons here, in Lincolnshire, everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.71,0:08:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都已准备战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're prepared to fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.40,0:08:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去拯救他们的所爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}to save what they love.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.67,0:08:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他们需要首领\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they need captains,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.13,0:08:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们需要有智慧 有学识的人来领导他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}they need clever, educated man to lead them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.33,0:09:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我绝不是个领袖人物 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm no leader, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.35,0:09:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别仓促决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't decide now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.49,0:09:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们将会召开一次会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll call a meeting,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.55,0:09:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会后决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}then decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.72,0:09:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了上帝的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the love of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.98,0:09:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.47,0:09:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的特使在索里修道院发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our commisioners found it in Sawly Abbey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.89,0:09:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是怎么弄的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was it done?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.81,0:09:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自己看\N{\fnArial\fs30}See it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.57,0:09:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人们以为圣徒的骨骼依然是活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}People thought the saint's bones were alive…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.23,0:09:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们被用来做祈福\N{\fnArial\fs30}use it work for benedictions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.49,0:09:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他们向教堂及罗马捐一点钱的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they pay a little money they had to the church and to Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.51,0:09:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的改革进展如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do our reforms progress?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.52,0:09:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如您所知 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you know, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.62,0:10:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}议会正在为镇压\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parliament has now voted for the suppression.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.14,0:10:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小修道院的事情投票\N{\fnArial\fs30}of all the small monastery houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.37,0:10:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而国王特使们的几乎在英格兰每个郡\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the commisioners are upon and about their businesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.84,0:10:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都采取了行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}in nearly every county in England…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.45,0:10:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有没有受到反抗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much opposition?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.83,0:10:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有我们预计的多\N{\fnArial\fs30}not as much as we might have expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.50,0:10:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何足担忧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}why should we have expected it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.79,0:10:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人们认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}People conceive for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.84,0:10:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些修道院都应该受到谴责\N{\fnArial\fs30}that all these houses should be condemned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.82,0:10:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们的罪过太显而易见了 声色犬马的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}for their manifest sin: carnal and abundable living.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.15,0:10:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人告诉我其中一件趣事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was told, one anecdote among many.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.54,0:10:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我们的特使来到伦敦十字修道僧院时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When our commisioners entered the London houses of the Crossed Friars.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.23,0:10:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们竟然看见祈祷者自己乱作一团\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found the prayer himself, in babel disorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.20,0:10:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都全身赤裸 满脸惊愕\N{\fnArial\fs30}both stunned and naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.98,0:10:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他经常以贿赂来逃脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}they often bribes to go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.95,0:10:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确实如此 那些普通人一旦得势\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is true that ordinary people are so greedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.66,0:10:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就会变的过份贪婪\N{\fnArial\fs30}upon these houses when they are suppressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.33,0:10:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们不分昼夜地搜刮 直到什么都不剩下\N{\fnArial\fs30}they scavenge in the night and day untill nothing is left.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.85,0:10:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们甚至拿书本去当厕纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}they even take the books, to use for paper in their houses of easement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.01,0:10:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下的财政收入如何了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about the gains of King's treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.20,0:10:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到目前为止 我估计\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far, by my reckoning,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.99,0:10:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们已经让国王的收入翻倍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have already doubled the King's income.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.79,0:11:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接收的修道院的土地\N{\fnArial\fs30}and taken in possesion of the monastic lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.68,0:11:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}价值数百万英镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}worth many millions of pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.67,0:11:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}数百万？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Millions?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.59,0:11:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正是 秘书大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Mr. Secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.15,0:11:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱德华·西摩爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Edward Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.01,0:11:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱德华爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Edward,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.94,0:11:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为国王陛下爱妻珍的兄长\N{\fnArial\fs30}as the brother of His Majesty's beloved wife, Jane,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.28,0:11:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天 国王陛下欣然敕封你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is his Majesty's pleasure today to creat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.82,0:11:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为萨默塞特郡 哈彻之伯查子爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Viscount Beauchamp of Hache in Somerset,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.72,0:11:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时任命你为泽西的总督\N{\fnArial\fs30}also to appoint you a governor of Jersy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.23,0:11:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及北威尔士的大法官\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Chancellor of North Wales.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.86,0:11:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下 我深感荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, I'm deeply honoured.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.78,0:11:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向您保证 我将为陛下利益\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I assure your Majesty that I would labor…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.93,0:11:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鞠躬尽瘁 死而后已\N{\fnArial\fs30}unremittingly in your Majesty's interest,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.16,0:11:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以回报您对我的信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the hope of repaying the great trust you've shown in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.13,0:12:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 此乃册封您的英王制诰\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lord, here are your Letters patent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.71,0:12:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恭喜您的升迁\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I congratulate you on your elevation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.12,0:12:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢秘书大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Secratary.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.15,0:12:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯 有何内务？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas, what are the businesses there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.44,0:12:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吾王陛下已收到来自皇帝的贺信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty has received a letter from the Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.68,0:12:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恭喜陛下的新婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}congratulating your new marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.58,0:12:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他已经不再阻碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since he's no further impediment,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.31,0:12:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并非常急切地寻求结盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's very anxious to become a new accommodation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.46,0:12:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不错 还有呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.02,0:12:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽女士也给你来信 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lady Mary has also written to you, Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.69,0:12:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她想怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does she want?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.60,0:12:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她说 是时候忘记不愉快的过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She writes, that it is time now to forget the unhappy past,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.02,0:12:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她乞求陛下的原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}she begs to be taken by your Majesty's forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.80,0:12:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并恳求陛下理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}and humbly beseeches you to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.46,0:12:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「我是个谦卑的女人 也是您的孩子」\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I am a humbled woman and your child.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.00,0:12:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我绝不会召她回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never take her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.05,0:12:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除非她先在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not until she first submit herself to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.25,0:12:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她母亲的婚姻事情上服从王意且付诸书面\N{\fnArial\fs30}the subject of his mother's marriage and surprint.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.70,0:12:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可派人前去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll send the delegation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.00,0:12:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若她真想忘记过去的不幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}if she trully wants to forget the unhappy past,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.86,0:13:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就签署文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}then she can stop by signing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.37,0:13:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.02,0:13:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Groom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.99,0:13:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弗兰西斯爵士 我有好消息告知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Sir Francis. I have some good news for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.07,0:13:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下已经恩准\N{\fnArial\fs30}His majesty has agreed to your appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.22,0:13:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}任命您为枢密官\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a gentleman of the Privy Chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.37,0:13:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我知道了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure I know. thanks for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.75,0:13:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很快我就会给您份差事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may have a small job for you, soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.31,0:13:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 大使阁下 - 国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excellency. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.01,0:13:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我来 我带你去见一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me. there's someone I wish to present you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.50,0:13:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}珍王后 请允许我向您引见尤斯塔斯·乔普斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queen Jane.Allow me to introduce his Excellency Eustace Chapuys,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.43,0:13:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}皇帝查尔斯五世之大使阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ambassador to the emperor Charles V, Spain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.87,0:13:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大使阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.87,0:13:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们单独谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I leave you to talk in private.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.14,0:13:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后陛下 请允许我祝您婚姻幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, may I congratulate on your marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.73,0:13:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也祝愿你身体健康 事事如意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish you good health and prosperity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:14:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然提议您登王位的那位女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although the device of the lady who proceeded you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.79,0:14:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最感高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the throne was the most happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.90,0:14:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我毫无疑问 你自已乃是天命所归\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no doubt that it is you, yourself who will realise that mortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.78,0:14:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.11,0:14:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道皇帝陛下将为有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that the emperor will rejoice of.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.53,0:14:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此高贵而和善的王后感到高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}such a virtual ascent and amiable queen on the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.22,0:14:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毫不夸张地说 我所见到的每个英国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must tell you it would be impossible for me to overstate the joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.66,0:14:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在听说你结婚时\N{\fnArial\fs30}and happiness which each Englsih men I have met.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.72,0:14:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都异常高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}have expressed to me on hearing of your marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.03,0:14:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特别是听说您将作为和平使者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially, as it is said, that you're a peace-maker who'll be continually.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.20,0:14:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}力促国王陛下与其女玛丽和解\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to persuade his majesty to restore his daughter Mary to favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.31,0:14:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阁下 我答应你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise you, excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.21,0:14:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会继续关照玛丽女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I would continue to show favor to the Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.84,0:14:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将尽最大的努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}And do my best to deserve the title of peace-maker.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.93,0:14:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也不枉您赠我「和平使者」的称号\N{\fnArial\fs30}you so gallantly have given me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.51,0:14:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你这么做 我想你会发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you do so, I think you'll find Madam that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.82,0:14:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 不用辛劳 也不用生育\N{\fnArial\fs30}without the pain of labour, and childbirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.36,0:14:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就可以得到拥有女儿的快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll gain a treasure of the daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.16,0:15:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个会比你和国王的亲生孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}who may please you even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.72,0:15:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更让你开心的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}than your own children by the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.02,0:15:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只能重申 大使阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can only say again, Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.66,0:15:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将尽最大的努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I will do my best to restore the peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.34,0:15:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来促使国王和他长女的和解\N{\fnArial\fs30}between the King and his eldest daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.95,0:15:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 大使 - 夫人告退\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ambassordor - Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.78,0:15:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人告退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.93,0:15:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您是她接见的第一位大使\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the first ambassordor she's received.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.36,0:15:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她还不习惯这样的会见\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is not yet used to see such audiences.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.67,0:15:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但有一点他们没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it is true what they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.57,0:15:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她善良而平易近人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is kind and amiable,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.47,0:15:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并主张和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}and much inclined towards peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.95,0:15:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发誓 举个例子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear, for example,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.85,0:15:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她会竭力阻止我与外国宣战\N{\fnArial\fs30}she would strive to prevent me taking part in a foreign war.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.93,0:15:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是为避免与我分离的恐惧和痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}if only to avoid the fear and pain of separation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.91,0:15:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果发生战事 陛下 敌方是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are on war, your majesty, against whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.08,0:15:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是打个比方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was talking hypothetically.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.83,0:15:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 您自己会考虑这个问题的 大使阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely you'll do that youself, your excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.54,0:16:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你们的到来 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for coming. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.87,0:16:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋友们 朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friends! Friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.00,0:16:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们来到这里 是为了能够得到智者的指导\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've come here, so you can listen to and talk to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.13,0:16:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伯特·阿斯克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}this good man, Mr. Robert Aske.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.02,0:16:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们有人知道他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now some of you have already known him,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.36,0:16:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是北安普顿公爵的律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}he is the Duke of Northampton's legal man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.45,0:16:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他为人公正\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's always been honest and fair minded.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.69,0:16:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对平民百姓一视同仁\N{\fnArial\fs30}in these dealings with the commons so…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.78,0:16:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是让阿斯克先生自己来讲吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Aske can speak for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.28,0:16:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女士们 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and Gentlmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.58,0:16:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 说说你们是如何想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, tell me what is your want.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.53,0:17:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿斯克先生 我们的信仰的圣日都被废除 取消了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Aske, all of our faith days were abolished and gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.03,0:17:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是否可以请求国王开恩恢复我们的圣日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should it pleased the King's grace that we might have our Holy days back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.72,0:17:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们想修复我们的修道院\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want our abbeyes restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.32,0:17:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并要求停止推行异端邪说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And demand that this advance of heresy be halted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.01,0:17:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们希望这个新的邪恶主教克朗默被革除\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want this new heretic Bishop like Cranmer be casted off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.32,0:17:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至克伦威尔也应该由出身高贵的人所替代\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even Cromwell to be surplanted by man of noble birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.30,0:17:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们听说 阿斯克先生 要实行新的税收\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hear rumors, Mr. Aske, that new taxes levy's against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.52,0:17:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}牲畜要征税 洗礼要征税\N{\fnArial\fs30}on our cattle, and our christenings,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.87,0:17:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至连结婚 生育都要征税\N{\fnArial\fs30}on our marriages, and our births.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.42,0:17:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿斯克先生 他们甚至摧毁我们的教堂 窃取我们的财富\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aske, they even destroy our perish churches and steal our treasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.58,0:17:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道了 先生们 我知道了 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, gentlemen. All right, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.05,0:17:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们觉得 阻止他们的方法何在？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do you reckon you can do to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.48,0:17:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿斯克先生 在我们的土地 我们果实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Aske, before our lands, our good to their houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.41,0:17:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被国王特使们掠走之前 我们要战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}are taken from by the church commissioners.We'll fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.95,0:18:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}誓死战斗 直到取得胜利 阿斯克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll die, die after full ultimate, Mr. Aske.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.09,0:18:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你们都很愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you are angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.07,0:18:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}破坏修道院是一种卑劣行径 也是一种犯罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}the destruction of the abbeys is a terrible and criminal thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.27,0:18:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为修道院就是我们所有人理想的现实代表\N{\fnArial\fs30}since that represents by that very presence and exotic ideal to of all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.01,0:18:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是先生们 武装起义 反叛国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}But gentlemen, this call to arms, to rebellion against the king's grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.59,0:18:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这超出我的道德底线 我不能苟同\N{\fnArial\fs30}is something which are my conscience I cannot agree to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.66,0:18:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为国王是我们的支柱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since the King is our body and soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.32,0:18:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}攻击他就等同于攻击国家 亵渎上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then an attack upon him is an attack upon the commonwealth and upon God himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.95,0:18:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听到了吗 同伴们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear that, my mates?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.07,0:18:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这位绅士不在乎我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gentry doesn't care for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.48,0:18:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}基督为穷人而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ die for the poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.63,0:18:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这你忘了吗 阿斯克先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember that, Mr. Aske?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.36,0:18:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}厄苏拉·米塞尔登女士 王后陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Misseldon, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.75,0:19:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 米塞尔登女士 - 王后陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lady Misseldon - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.62,0:19:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请忠于职守\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do your duties honournably and virtuesly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并记住 你们的职责就是服务与服从\N{\fnArial\fs30}and remember, you are all bound to serve and obey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.13,0:19:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}洛克福特女士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Rochford?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.01,0:19:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.08,0:19:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这边来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.14,0:19:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我要求召见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ask to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.73,0:19:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道自从你丈夫被处决后 你的处境并不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that the things have not gone well for you since your husband was executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.50,0:19:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我早已被这个世界无情地抛弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been utterly abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.50,0:19:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我感到自己因为乔治的所作所为而备受指责\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel I was condemed because of what George did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.41,0:19:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至克伦威尔先生都拒绝回复我的信件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even Mr Cromwell has refused to answer my letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.39,0:19:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这一切不是你的错 乔治·波林自食其果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing was your fault.George Bolyen was his own keeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.93,0:19:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望你能回到王宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to come back to court.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.26,0:19:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有意任命你为首席侍从女官\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'd like to appoint you my principal lady in waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.91,0:19:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望你能接受这个任命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you'll accept this position.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.51,0:20:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 谢谢你 王后陛下 - 好了 洛克福特夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you, Your Majesty. - Well then, lady Rochford?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.05,0:20:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切都会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}all is well again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.06,0:20:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切都会弥补\N{\fnArial\fs30}All is mended up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.51,0:20:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弗兰西斯·布赖恩爵士参见 我的女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Francis Bryan, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.53,0:20:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 玛丽女士 - 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lady Mary - My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.91,0:20:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很高兴你能来看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very glad you've come to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.07,0:20:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我致函给国王恭贺其婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've written a letter congratulating the King on his marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.21,0:20:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并请求去做珍王后侍从\N{\fnArial\fs30}And begging leave to wait upon queen Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.99,0:20:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或是可以取悦王后的事务\N{\fnArial\fs30}or do her grace such services would please her to command me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.76,0:20:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我恐怕 玛丽女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid, Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.91,0:20:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是来这里说客套话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've not come here to discuss pleasentaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.46,0:20:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下敦促你签署这份文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty urged you to sign this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.61,0:20:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这是什么？- 一个条款清单\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - A list of articles.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.06,0:20:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尊国王为教会领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recognising the King as Head of the Church,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.34,0:20:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}指认你母亲的婚姻是非法而乱伦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your mother's marriage just incestuous and unlawful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.81,0:20:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还必须脱离罗马教廷\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must also renounce Rome and.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.90,0:20:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并公开承认自己是私生女\N{\fnArial\fs30}free acknowledged of your illegitamacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.81,0:21:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如你不签 恐怕克伦威尔大臣阁下难保你安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you not sign, I'm afraid Mr Secretary Cromwell can not guarantee your safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.34,0:21:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论我多么爱我的父亲 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}However much I love my father, your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.88,0:21:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且愿意做任何事情来取悦和满足他 但我依然不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}And would do anything to please and satisfy him, I still cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.75,0:21:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了一个古怪国王的宠爱 出卖自己的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}risk my mortal soul for the favor of an unearthly King.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.61,0:21:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真是个不孝女\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an unfitlial daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.34,0:21:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然你不服从你的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since you're not submit to your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.21,0:21:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么接下来他也许会以叛国罪来处置你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He may yet procceed against you for treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.05,0:21:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 他不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no he would not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.26,0:21:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我不相信 - 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I cannot believe it. - Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.52,0:21:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.90,0:21:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你是我的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you're my daugher,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.82,0:21:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会用你的脑袋撞墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would smash your head against the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.51,0:21:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到软得如同煮烂的苹果\N{\fnArial\fs30}until it is soft as a boiled apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.81,0:21:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明白了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.25,0:22:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.66,0:22:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我与荷尔拜因先生一起讨论了怎样为你加冕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been discussing plans for your coronation with Mr Holbein.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.18,0:22:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你听说过威尼斯的中心吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever heard of the centre of Venice?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.95,0:22:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.08,0:22:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是一艘船 每年威尼斯总督都会乘坐它出海\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a ship. in which the Doge travels out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.00,0:22:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在海上欢庆婚姻延绵\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the Lagoon every year to renew its marriage while the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.60,0:22:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常神奇的盛况 会伴随着满是金 铜雕像\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a magnificant thing. The dawn will gold and bronze, statues of,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.09,0:22:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}海神像 海狮和其他神奇的海洋生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neptune, sea lions and other fantastic sea creatures…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.77,0:22:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我准备建造它\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm going to build it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.82,0:22:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而你将乘船出去旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're going go travel in it,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.84,0:22:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从格林威治到被加冕的城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}from Greenwich to the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.04,0:22:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正式成为英格兰王后珍\N{\fnArial\fs30}where you'll be crowned, Queen Jane of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.51,0:22:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 此刻心情难以言表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, I… I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.19,0:22:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你无需多言\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.19,0:22:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这将是史上最隆重的英格兰王后加冕礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be the most fabulous coronation any English Queen has ever had,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.68,0:22:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这一点我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.77,0:23:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 请原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty. Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.36,0:23:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听闻陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've heard Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.32,0:23:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}起诉玛丽女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}make some proceedings against the Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.75,0:23:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真心请求你不要如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all my heart I beg you not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.84,0:23:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你失去理智了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you out of your senses?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.01,0:23:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别再谈论此类事务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk of such matters again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.99,0:23:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}珍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.19,0:23:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还另有结婚礼物送给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have another wedding gift for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.64,0:23:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望你喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.47,0:24:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.26,0:24:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我喜欢 他太漂亮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh I love him, he's so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.74,0:24:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}米塞尔登女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Misseldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.13,0:24:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弗兰西斯阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Francis.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.53,0:24:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 希望我没吓着你 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I hope I didn't alarm you. - No sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.44,0:24:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您留言说想见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left me a note that you wanted to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.54,0:24:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.91,0:24:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.23,0:25:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.47,0:25:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是否愿意作我的情妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you'd like to become my mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.01,0:25:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阁下 我已订婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I'm already engage to be married.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.77,0:25:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.69,0:25:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伯特·泰维斯托克爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Robert Tavistock.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.14,0:25:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他能给你买的起这样的礼物吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can he afford to buy you gifts like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.54,0:25:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认为他做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.81,0:25:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但如果贞操对你更为重要的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if it's more important to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.39,0:25:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那也悉听尊便\N{\fnArial\fs30}to keep your virgin then keep it for what it's worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.97,0:25:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且我发誓永不再烦扰你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I swear I wouldn't bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.50,0:25:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会令你良心难安\N{\fnArial\fs30}or your conscience ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.60,0:25:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还没有决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't decided yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.07,0:25:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我怎能否认罗马或我母亲的婚姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I renounce Rome or my mother's marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.09,0:25:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尤其在她遭受那么多痛苦之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all of my mother's sufferings.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.13,0:25:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.49,0:25:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我建议你大可签署这份文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}But may I suggest that you could sign the document.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.29,0:26:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之后另书言明脱离与所谓新教的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then make what is called a protestation apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.89,0:26:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此为有证人在场之摒弃你表面服从的秘密誓言\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is secretly foresware your submission before witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.59,0:26:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这岂不是虚伪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that not hypocrisy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.03,0:26:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我肯定皇帝以及教皇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely the emperor's against my signing such a document.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.67,0:26:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都会反对我签署该文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Holy Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.63,0:26:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Mary,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.86,0:26:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以实相告\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must tell you in honesty that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.18,0:26:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}皇帝陛下无意再\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the emperor's no longer inclined to.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.99,0:26:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进一步干涉此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}interfere any further in this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.42,0:26:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你毕竟不是他的臣民\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, you are not his subject and.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.15,0:26:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}况且他正在寻求与英格兰缔结新盟约\N{\fnArial\fs30}and since he is seeking a new alliance with the king,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.87,0:26:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不会做出任何冒犯英王之举\N{\fnArial\fs30}he would in truth be most reluctant.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.67,0:26:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他确实无法勉为其难\N{\fnArial\fs30}to offend him in any way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.05,0:26:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我只能孤军奋战了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, I'm on my own?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.41,0:26:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我不签呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I do not sign it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.77,0:27:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那国王极有可能会致你于死地\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is very possible that the king would put you to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.52,0:27:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.38,0:27:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你… 你不先读一下？- 不必\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you…do you not want to read it first? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.38,0:27:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只请求你祈祷上帝赦免我的所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only I ask if you can pray for absolution for what I've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.57,0:27:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要我还在世\N{\fnArial\fs30}So long as I live,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.64,0:27:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我永远不会原谅自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will never forgive myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.25,0:27:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}波尔神父？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father Pole?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.73,0:27:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes Your Eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.91,0:27:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是冯·瓦尔德堡红衣主教\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Cardinal Von Waldburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.72,0:27:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你追随来到罗马多久了 波尔神父？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have you been as the servant adhere in Rome, Father Pole?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.92,0:27:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将近一年 殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost a year Your Eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.44,0:28:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在英王有意表明脱离\N{\fnArial\fs30}I left England when to became clear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.32,0:28:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗马教廷时离开的英国\N{\fnArial\fs30}the king meant to break his obedience to see of Roman, our Holy Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.14,0:28:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个妓女安妮·波林死了或许是天意\N{\fnArial\fs30}The death of whore Anne Boleyn is perhaps providential.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.10,0:28:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教皇陛下祈盼英王亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}And His Holiness prays that King Henry would.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.87,0:28:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以抓住和解的神圣契机\N{\fnArial\fs30}grasp this divine opportunity for reconciliation.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.20,0:28:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哪怕仅仅一个姿态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one gesture,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.82,0:28:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}倾向于罗马教廷 即使一个很微小的举动\N{\fnArial\fs30}of he sounds to see of Rome, however small,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.68,0:28:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就可使他免于被逐出教会之祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}will allow him to leave the threat of excommunication.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.10,0:28:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}殿下请相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Eminence believe me,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.71,0:28:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那也是英国信徒所祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is something that the faithful of England are praying for.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.93,0:28:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我母亲 索尔兹伯里夫人在信中\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother, Lady Salisbury has written to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.59,0:28:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}表达了她的期望\N{\fnArial\fs30}expressing her hope that the new queen is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.84,0:28:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}新皇后是一位忠诚的天主教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}in her heart a true Catholic.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.74,0:28:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除期待之外 令堂或许还可有所作为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps your mother could do more than hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.40,0:28:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许波尔神父您\N{\fnArial\fs30}And perhaps you yourself Father Pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.48,0:28:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会考虑重返英格兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}might've considering returning to England.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.08,0:28:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以便影响事态发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}In order to influence events there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.84,0:28:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道 波尔神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, Father Pole,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.10,0:28:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我非常了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.24,0:29:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}简直是达娜公主再世\N{\fnArial\fs30}here is the real Danae?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.68,0:29:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她会激发你的欲望高涨\N{\fnArial\fs30}She would kindle your lust even higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.03,0:29:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只需轻触她的玉体\N{\fnArial\fs30}One touch, one mere touch of her body,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.88,0:29:24.41,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就使你涌起烈焰般欲望 （引自《萨蒂利孔》）\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your limbs will melt in the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.52,0:29:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}项链很配你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The necklace suits you,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.97,0:29:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可爱之极\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're adored.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.58,0:30:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奉圣父 圣子 及圣神之名 阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}In nomine Patris, et Filii, et Spiritus Sancti. Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.67,0:30:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}万福玛利亚 满被圣宠者 主与尔偕焉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ave Maria, gratia plena, Dominus tecum.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.10,0:30:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 布赖恩女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty has received a letter from Lady Bryan,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.86,0:30:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊丽莎白女士之监护人来信\N{\fnArial\fs30}governors to the Lady Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.12,0:30:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}显然这孩子已长大 穿不下旧衣服了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently the child has outgrown her clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.73,0:30:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她要求陛下恩准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Bryan asks if Your Majesty would permit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.07,0:30:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为那孩子添置新衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}her to purchase new ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.82,0:30:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我非得如此吗 我都不相信她是我的骨肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should I? I don't believe she is my child.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.15,0:30:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全世界都知道她父亲是亨利·诺里斯这个叛党\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole world knows their father's a traitor Henry Norris.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.15,0:30:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她母亲就是个娼妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}and their mother was a whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.48,0:30:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.25,0:30:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽女士呈上了顺从函\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's letters, the submission of the Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.26,0:30:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你来安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will make arrangements.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.98,0:30:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会亲自偕同王后面见她\N{\fnArial\fs30}for myself and the Queen to meet with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.03,0:30:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但不是在这 私下进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not here and not publicly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.73,0:30:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们可以去她的住处\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will go to her residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.77,0:31:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}城内有关瘟疫的流言四起\N{\fnArial\fs30}There're rumors of plague in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.36,0:31:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加冕礼无疑是要推迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coronation would have to be postponed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.31,0:31:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.90,0:31:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.37,0:31:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理查德先生给我汇报了收入金额\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr.Richard showed me the figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.97,0:31:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对你甚为满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very pleased with you Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.49,0:31:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会很快施恩与你为证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will shortly prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.53,0:31:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}洛克福特女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Rochford.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.51,0:31:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.48,0:31:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将这交予布赖恩女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this to Lady Bryan,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.94,0:31:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}令她为伊丽莎白女士添置衣物\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell her to use it buy clothes for the Lady Elisabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.15,0:31:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.40,0:31:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还得考虑下玛丽女士的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you must think of a gift for the Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.85,0:31:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我热切期望能与她相见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking so forward to meeting her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.72,0:31:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下宅心仁厚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty is very kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.57,0:32:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}洛克福特女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Rochford,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.91,0:32:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你丈夫背叛并非你的过错\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not your fault that your husband betrayed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.05,0:32:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}生于帝王之家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor is it Mary's fault or Elizabeth's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.02,0:32:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也并非玛丽或伊丽莎白之错\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be born of a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.09,0:32:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女人多半是牺牲品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Women are much put upon in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.90,0:32:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我恳切希望在我力所能及之内为她们争取利益\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my desire as much as I can to promote their interests.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.68,0:32:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会悄然行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must do it quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.03,0:32:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我会一如既往\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I will do it all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.70,0:32:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信你能帮助我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I trust you'd help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.85,0:32:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.51,0:32:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}姓名\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.08,0:32:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查理 先生 查理·罗尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, sir. Charlie Roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.19,0:32:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 职业？- 牧羊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Trade? - Shepherd.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.56,0:32:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔国务秘书阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Secretary Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.57,0:32:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跪礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kneel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.96,0:33:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查理 你是否已经了解清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know well about it, Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.79,0:33:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 阿斯克首领\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Captain Aske.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.23,0:33:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我等并非叛乱者\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not rebels,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.00,0:33:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实为朝圣者\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're Pilgrimages.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.20,0:33:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们将举行朝圣行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we have a pilgrimage to go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.53,0:33:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你想加入我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.96,0:33:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么请务必向我们万能的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you shall swear to be true to our mighty God.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.13,0:33:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向基督天主教会\N{\fnArial\fs30}To Christ Catholic Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.65,0:33:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向我们至高无上的国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}To our sovereign lord, the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.15,0:33:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向王国之内的平民百姓发誓 上帝保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to the commons of this realm, so help you God.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.06,0:33:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.45,0:33:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}戴上徽章\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wear this badge.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.03,0:33:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上面印有基督之五伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}It show the five wounds of Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.18,0:33:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}证明平民们乃为基督而奋争\N{\fnArial\fs30}To prove that the commons will fight in Christ cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.87,0:33:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 首领\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.27,0:33:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 上帝保佑你 查理 - 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God bless you, Charlie. - Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.85,0:33:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}钦此 托马斯·克伦威尔阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arise, Sir Thomas Cromwell,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.75,0:33:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亦即温布尔登的克伦威尔男爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}also Baron Cromwell of Wimbledon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.91,0:34:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从即日起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And from this day forth,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.19,0:34:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就任掌玺大臣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Privy Seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.76,0:34:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.10,0:34:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace. Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.12,0:34:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以吗 小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.33,0:34:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝与你同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}God be with you Lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.32,0:34:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下真是慷慨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty is too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.44,0:34:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽 物质礼物无可比拟内心的收获\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary, gifts like these are easy compared with gifts of a heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.77,0:34:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能见到你们父女和解\N{\fnArial\fs30}It gives more pleasure than I can say.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.84,0:35:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我来说幸莫大焉\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see you reconcile with your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.80,0:35:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 玛丽 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mary. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.76,0:35:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是一千克朗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here is enough for a thousand crowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.62,0:35:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但有所需 尽管开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you need anything else you need only ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.46,0:35:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.44,0:35:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.92,0:36:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.07,0:36:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽那么恬美感性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary's so sweet and affectional.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.04,0:36:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}堪称完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's everything I heard should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.26,0:36:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她于身具有的美德与善良\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems to be no wonder she's so marvelous and beloved.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.75,0:36:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}广为民众深深爱戴就不足为奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}for her virtue and goodness in the hearts of the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.96,0:36:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下当邀请她进宫 昭告天下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty must invite her to the court, show her off.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.72,0:36:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.52,0:36:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您为何都不和我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why were you not speak to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.05,0:37:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我很失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.86,0:37:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.15,0:37:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我为你还没有身孕而感到失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm disappointed because you're not yet with child.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.22,0:37:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord, my lord, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.63,0:37:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们有急情禀告\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have come here in great haste.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.09,0:37:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}北部大部分地区\N{\fnArial\fs30}To tell you that the great part of the north.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.91,0:37:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及林肯郡部分地区\N{\fnArial\fs30}as well as part of Lincolnshire.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.23,0:37:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}突发反王叛乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}have risen in sudden rebellion against His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.56,0:37:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}平民叛乱者到处都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are master of commons everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.86,0:37:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叛乱者们四处燃起硝烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The beacons of rebellion burning their own light to cross the hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.27,0:37:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}四天之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just four days ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.66,0:37:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我们在收税时\N{\fnArial\fs30}while we're collecting taxes and hectinsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.93,0:37:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们被一帮愤怒的暴徒所埋伏\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were set upon by an angry mob.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.81,0:37:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们掳走了其中一名名叫尼古拉·拜楼的特使\N{\fnArial\fs30}They captured one of the Commissioners call Nicolas Bello.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.85,0:37:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将他拖下马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull him down from his hourse.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.33,0:37:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鞭打折磨他致死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and beat him to death with their stave.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.29,0:38:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这些人中 我们看到牧师也武装起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Among them, my lord, we saw armed priests.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.09,0:38:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些叛乱者叫嚣着他们的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Urging on these rebellion's names.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.70,0:38:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杀了他们 杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and cries "kill them, kill them".
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.17,0:38:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们还听说另外一人 威廉姆·里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we heard another man, william Lichie.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.52,0:38:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个效忠于您托马斯·克伦威尔的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who is known to be your servant Mr.Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.82,0:38:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被吊死在树上\N{\fnArial\fs30}have been hanged from a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.53,0:38:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些叛乱分子想要求什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and what these Rebels said they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.77,0:38:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据目前所知 他们想保留他们的圣日\N{\fnArial\fs30}so far I can tell you, they want to keep their holy days.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.19,0:38:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们要求恢复修道院 净化教会 而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}they want monasteries restored and their church unelested, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.83,0:38:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不再加税\N{\fnArial\fs30}no more taxed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.71,0:38:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听说他们已经宣布继续进军\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard they declared they prospaid with their journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.65,0:38:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们想要杀您 克伦威尔大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They intend to kill you, my Lord Crownwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.88,0:38:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}4至5个主教 还有里奇大法官\N{\fnArial\fs30}4 or 5 bishops, and Chancellor Richie.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.10,0:38:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罪名是掠夺教会财物 颠覆教会\N{\fnArial\fs30}as deviced taken church goods, and tearing down churches.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.03,0:38:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么当地士绅不去镇压这些反叛而只是坐等\N{\fnArial\fs30}why dont the local Gentry intervince and serpress these traitors and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.19,0:38:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们本该保护他们的土地甚于圣日\N{\fnArial\fs30}surely they want to protect their lands than Holy Days.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.76,0:38:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们尝试过 但更多的叛乱者继续杀回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}they tried, but the Rebels then come back even greater.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.58,0:38:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人说 克伦威尔大人 他们不止几百人\N{\fnArial\fs30}some say, my lord Crownwell, they are not hundreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.35,0:38:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而是数千信仰反叛者反对国王的教会改革\N{\fnArial\fs30}but thousands religion rebelions against the King's Church reforms.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.47,0:39:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为何毫无察觉 你本该洞悉所发生的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}why did you know, you are suposed to know everything that goes on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.37,0:39:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你禀告我只是略有反抗 而事实却相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}you told me there was little opposition, on the contrary.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.78,0:39:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你告诉我多数人欣然看到解散那些寺院\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me that most people was glad to see such places dissolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.62,0:39:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你大错特错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.68,0:39:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一无所知 混账\N{\fnArial\fs30}you didnot know anything, knave.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.24,0:39:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坐下 这么写\N{\fnArial\fs30}sit down, write this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.57,0:39:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我臣民无端起事\N{\fnArial\fs30}we take it as greatest unkindness, that our common.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.37,0:39:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们认为此为最大恶意\N{\fnArial\fs30}unfearist objects should rise agasint without any grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.41,0:39:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吾本无意夺取教会物资\N{\fnArial\fs30}As for taking the goods from perish Church which is never intended.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.41,0:39:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现却属意\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet even it had been intended… True subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.72,0:39:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真我子民断不该对其王公以武力相向\N{\fnArial\fs30}would have not dealt with me, Their Princess in such Violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.63,0:39:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而本当谐从王意\N{\fnArial\fs30}but would petition me for that purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.26,0:39:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今我命尔等叛乱者立刻返回家园 三缄其口\N{\fnArial\fs30}now I command you Rebels to go home, and say no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.68,0:40:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}牢记尔等本分 你们生而本当听命于我 你们的国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}and remember your allegiance, you are duly bound to to obey me, your King.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.14,0:40:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此乃上帝诫令及天地自然法则\N{\fnArial\fs30}both by God's Commoments, and by the law of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.61,0:40:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全体人民 集合了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All commands, stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.11,0:40:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在该揭竿而起了 从今往后\N{\fnArial\fs30}now it's the time to arise, for else ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.36,0:40:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}前进 向约克郡进发\N{\fnArial\fs30}so forwards, forwrds to York.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.41,0:40:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不怕牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forwards in pain of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.31,0:40:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以上帝的名义 前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forwards in God's Name, Forwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.57,0:40:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在给约克郡的士绅们写信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Writing to the Gentry of Yorkshire.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.15,0:40:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}提醒他们镇压叛乱的职责 否则罪责难逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}reminding them of their duties to suppress these traitors, penalties in not doing so.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.49,0:41:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是否可以考虑暂停教会特使的工作 等叛乱…\N{\fnArial\fs30}so any case, for suspending the work of church commisioners, until rebels …
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.45,0:41:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝不 借北方暴民之手\N{\fnArial\fs30}no, the only way to beat the king's.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.02,0:41:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打击国王权威的唯一办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}authority into the hands of rude people of North.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.06,0:41:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是向他们表明王意继续宗教改革\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to show them King's intend to continue with reformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.10,0:41:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者叫宗教改良 不管他们怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}and correction religion whatever they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.66,0:41:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管他们怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}what ever they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.27,0:41:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.71,0:41:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.01,0:41:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叛乱分子已经夺取了林肯郡\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Rebels have taken Lincoln.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.29,0:41:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叛军的旗子在城门飘扬\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Rebels flag flies over city gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.72,0:41:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更多的叛军已向约克郡挺进\N{\fnArial\fs30}and more of them are now marching on York.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.87,0:41:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, Help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.34,0:41:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我5岁时 我和母亲被送到伦敦 进入伦敦塔内\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was 5, my mother and I were taken accross London, into the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.11,0:42:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那时发生了针对我父王的叛乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was a rebelion against my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.84,0:42:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些康沃尔叛军已经攻到了城墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Cornish rebels reached the city walls,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.35,0:42:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}城内充满恐慌和畏惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and inside everything was panic, fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.67,0:42:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既无消息来源 也无我父王军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}with no news at all, nor army of my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.26,0:42:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我母亲力图保持镇静 但其实吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}my mother tried to remain calm, she was terrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.80,0:42:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我当时也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So was I,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.19,0:42:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我那时以为所有人会被杀掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was sure we were both going to be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.86,0:42:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我现命你为王室军队总指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm appointing you command of the Royal forces,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.64,0:42:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽快赶到北方去\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will arrive North as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.02,0:42:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会找到军火 不可久留\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will find guns and ordnances of hunger, but don't tarry there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.48,0:42:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会 陛下 我将悉遵王命 及更甚\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Your Majesty, I will do all Your Majesty Commands and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.29,0:43:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些暴民就是叛国者 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}these rebels are our traitors, Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.67,0:43:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们满是邪恶与罪孽\N{\fnArial\fs30}full of wretched and devilish intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.73,0:43:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}必须严惩他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}they must be punished,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.65,0:43:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们居然对他们的主公犯下大逆不道的反叛罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}for their detestable and unmature sin of rebellion against their Sirvior.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.86,0:43:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像我的父王 惩戒那些康沃尔郡人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just as my father, punish the cornishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.91,0:43:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查尔斯 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles, What is going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.29,0:43:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 退下 - 遵命 公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Leave us. - Yes Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.59,0:43:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下已命我领军去北方平叛\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty has charged me would lead his army against North Rebels.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.95,0:43:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不必担心 我还有后援军队去包抄他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not to worry, I will have my back enough men and arms to subdue them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.95,0:43:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这很容易 国王已经承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}easily, I have his Majesty's promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.96,0:43:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看在上帝的份上 希望他能遵守\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope to God, He keeps it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.15,0:43:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很高兴接受此项任命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm happy to accept this charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.93,0:43:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔才是一切的祸根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crownwell is being blamed for everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.23,0:43:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叛军如有天助 意欲要取他的人头\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Rebels is demanding his head with God's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.25,0:43:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我或许乐意奉上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may will be able to deliver it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.93,0:44:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}掌玺大臣觐见\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lord Privy Seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.92,0:45:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将派遣沙福克公爵率领王室军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll despatch Duke of Surffolk to the Royal Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.27,0:45:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看我们是否该继续派遣第二支平叛军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we need to send the second army to destroy the rebels.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.66,0:45:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Your Mejesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.43,0:45:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除非他们自行解散\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless they disperse.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.08,0:45:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}责令沙福克公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}and said 100 of their ringleaders to the Duke of Surffolk.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.81,0:45:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吊死百名叛军头目\N{\fnArial\fs30}of with halters around their necks.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.25,0:45:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并宣布我准许烧毁他们的所有财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}then he has our permission to burn to destroy all their goods.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.00,0:45:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以对我的臣民们以儆效尤\N{\fnArial\fs30}and make a fearful example of them to all of our subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.94,0:45:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.38,0:45:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他们还不投降 克伦威尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}If still they do not submit, Mr. Cromwell,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.47,0:45:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我保证会全然毁灭他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I promise the utter destruction of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.60,0:45:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}包括他们的妻子 子女\N{\fnArial\fs30}their wives and their children.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.99,0:45:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你明白吗 我将毁灭他们的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand me? I will destroy them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.40,0:46:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后我就会把你毁掉 克伦威尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I'll destroy you, Cromwell.
